    <briefdescription>
<para>Hybrid Retention Manager. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manages a three-stage retention strategy that balances storage efficiency with analytical capability and anomaly preservation.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">HybridRetentionConfig<sp/>config;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">config.stage2.low_cv_threshold<sp/>=<sp/>3.0;<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>More<sp/>aggressive</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_hybrid_retention_manager_1a5c22131fbb4f4ac4bbfbdc72db2e94cd" kindref="member">HybridRetentionManager</ref><sp/>manager(query_engine,<sp/>tsstore,<sp/>scheduler,<sp/>config);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">manager.start();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>runs<sp/>automatically<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>stats<sp/>=<sp/>manager.getStats();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Storage<sp/>saved:<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>stats.total_storage_bytes_saved<sp/>/<sp/>1024<sp/>/<sp/>1024<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;<sp/>MB&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>std::endl;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">manager.stop();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
